# The series that make up this fork's main branch.
#
# main is the base below plus the commits of the series listed here, applied in
# this order by tools/fork/series.sh, which also checks each series, as far as
# the series' tips pass tier 1 (.github/workflows/fork-integrate.yml). Each
# series is a branch holding one work item as a clean stack of commits on the
# base, or on the series it is declared "on" when it builds on them or
# conflicts with them. Moving to a newer upstream release means changing the
# base and rebasing every series onto it.
#
# Lines: "base TAG", then "BRANCH [on BRANCH...]"; "#" starts a comment.

